sequenceDiagram
    actor Arsiparis
    participant Frontend
    participant Server
    participant Database
    
    Arsiparis->>Frontend: Buka Inbox Arsip (Dokumen status COMPLETED)
    Frontend->>Server: GET /api/arsip/pending
    Server->>Database: Query dokumen_transaksi WHERE status='COMPLETED'
    Database-->>Server: List Dokumen
    Server-->>Frontend: Tampilkan Dokumen Siap Arsip
    
    Arsiparis->>Frontend: Input Nomor Surat, Klasifikasi, Retensi
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/arsip/finalize
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO arsip metadata
    Server->>Database: UPDATE dokumen_transaksi (status: ARCHIVED)
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO log_aktivitas (aksi: ARCHIVED)
    Database-->>Server: Success
    Server-->>Frontend: Dokumen Resmi Diarsipkan
